"Every alignment" takes one role if you're good enough (Priest or Monk),
and can be done in two while only playing wombats (two barbarians and a
samurai or lawful valkyrie, or two valkyries and a chaotic barbarian).

"Every race" can be done in two roles if you're good enough to ascend
all four flavours of Ranger. (Ranger gets you Elf Orc Human Gnome,
leaving Dwarf, which can be any one of Archaeologist, Caveman, or
Valkyrie.)  It's probably easier to do it with three (Wizard, Barbarian,
and Valkyrie cover all five races between them).  "Every race" of course
gets you "every alignment" for free.
